@startuml
' State diagram: stock of an ingredient - Inventory & POS System v0.18.2 (report, Lecture 5)
' Edit: paste into draw.io (Arrange > Insert > Advanced > PlantUML) or planttext.com
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
}
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
}
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  HeaderBackgroundColor #E6F1EE
}
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
}
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
}
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor White
  ParticipantBorderColor Black
  LifeLineBorderColor #888888
  ActorBorderColor Black
  ActorBackgroundColor White
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFBEA
  BorderColor #C9B458
}
skinparam swimlaneWidth same
hide circle

[*] --> OK
OK : on hand > warn at
Low : 0 < on hand <= warn at
Out : on hand = 0
OK --> Low : sale or count goes to warn at or below
Low --> OK : restock or count above warn at
Low --> Out : sale or count reaches 0
Out --> Low : restock / count, still at or below warn at
Out --> OK : restock / count above warn at
OK --> Out : count = 0
note right of Out
  Drinks that need it can't be added
  to a basket ("Not enough ...").
end note
@enduml
